config BR2_PACKAGE_HBAS_IOCD
	bool "hbas-iocd"
	help
	  IOC (front/IO controller) link daemon: answers the IOC's power
	  keep-alive like the stock firmware, handles shutdown requests,
	  and forwards bike CAN frames to a SocketCAN interface (vcan0).
	  Sources live in software/iocd in the HogTiedOS repository.
